"Less drawing for the emulated CPUs: window and Dock animations, desktop widgets, the screen saver and a moving wallpaper go. Open Terminal on the Mac, tap the button and press Return, then log out and back in. Also turn on Reduce Motion and Reduce Transparency in the Mac's System Settings, Accessibility. Undo puts it back, apart from the wallpaper. Needs the Mac's keyboard layout to be U.S." = "通过关闭窗口与 Dock 动画、桌面小组件、屏幕保护程序及动态壁纸来减少模拟 CPU 的绘制工作。先在 Mac 上打开“终端”，点击上方按钮并按回车，再退出登录并重新登录。建议同时在“系统设置 → 辅助功能”中开启“减弱动态效果”和“降低透明度”。恢复命令可撤销大多数修改，但不恢复壁纸。Mac 键盘布局需设为美式英语。";
