"A Mac needs memory it can write and then run, which on iOS only an attached debugger can grant. Choose how your %1$@ gets one." = "运行虚拟 Mac 需要能够生成并执行代码的内存。iOS 要求先通过调试器启用 JIT。请选择在这台 %1$@ 上启用 JIT 的方式。";
