"No computer needed. Pairs from Settings in a minute." = "无需电脑，可直接在系统设置中完成配对。";
"Import a pairing file made on a computer." = "导入电脑生成的配对文件。";
"StikDebug is installed." = "已安装 StikDebug。";
"Enable JIT through the StikDebug app." = "通过 StikDebug 应用启用 JIT。";
"TrollStore is installed." = "已安装 TrollStore。";
"For a Henge installed through TrollStore." = "适用于通过 TrollStore 安装的 Henge。";
"JIT was already on when Henge opened." = "Henge 启动时 JIT 已开启。";
"A jailbreak was found. Turn on Allow JIT in Apps." = "检测到越狱环境，请启用“允许应用使用 JIT”。";
"Dopamine can give every app JIT with one setting." = "Dopamine 可通过一项设置允许应用使用 JIT。";
"Henge pretends to be a computer on your Wi-Fi, and your %1$@ pairs with it the way it would with a Mac." = "Henge 会在同一 Wi-Fi 网络中模拟一台电脑，让这台 %1$@ 像与 Mac 配对一样完成设备配对。";
"Turn on Wi-Fi, tap **Start pairing** below and allow Local Network access." = "打开 Wi-Fi，点击下方的**开始配对**，并允许使用本地网络。";
"Open **Settings › Privacy & Security › Developer Mode**, scroll down and tap **Pair with %2$@**." = "打开**设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式**，向下找到并点击**与 %2$@ 配对**。";
"Enter the code Henge shows. It also appears in a banner and a notification, so you don't have to switch back." = "输入 Henge 显示的配对码。它也会出现在横幅及通知中，无需来回切换。";
"Come back to Henge." = "返回 Henge。";
"Waiting for your %1$@…" = "正在等待这台 %1$@…";
"This installation can only wait about 30 seconds in the background, so go to Settings straight away." = "Henge 在后台只能短暂等待约 30 秒，请立即前往系统设置完成配对。";
"Enter this code on your %1$@" = "请在这台 %1$@ 上输入以下验证码";
"A pairing file made on a computer lets Henge talk to this %1$@ the same way." = "电脑生成的配对文件可以让 Henge 与这台 %1$@ 建立调试连接。";
"On a computer, make this %1$@'s pairing file with the [StikDebug pairing-file guide](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug-Guide/blob/main/pairing_file.md)." = "在电脑上参照 [StikDebug 配对文件指南](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug-Guide/blob/main/pairing_file.md)，生成这台 %1$@ 的配对文件。";
"Save it to Files, or AirDrop it to this %1$@." = "将配对文件保存到“文件”应用，或通过隔空投送发送到这台 %1$@。";
"Tap **Choose pairing file** and pick it." = "点击**选择配对文件**并选中该文件。";
"Henge's helper reaches this %1$@'s debugging service through a local VPN. Nothing leaves your %1$@." = "Henge 的辅助程序通过本地 VPN 连接这台 %1$@ 的调试服务，配对通信不会离开本机。";
"Install [LocalDevVPN](%3$@) from the App Store." = "从 App Store 安装 [LocalDevVPN](%3$@)。";
"Tap **Connect LocalDevVPN**. It switches the VPN on and comes straight back to Henge." = "点击**连接 LocalDevVPN**，开启本地 VPN 后会自动返回 Henge。";
"Leave it connected whenever you turn JIT on." = "每次启用 JIT 时，请保持 LocalDevVPN 已连接。";
"The first check downloads and mounts Apple's Developer Disk Image, which can take a minute." = "首次检测需要下载并挂载 Apple 的开发者磁盘映像，可能需要一些时间。";
"Tap **Check setup**. Henge checks LocalDevVPN and prepares the Developer Disk Image." = "点击**检查配置**。Henge 将检测 LocalDevVPN 并准备开发者磁盘映像。";
"Tap **Enable JIT**. Henge's helper attaches and a Mac can start." = "点击**启用 JIT**，等待辅助程序连接成功后即可启动虚拟 Mac。";
"StikDebug is a separate app that attaches to Henge. Henge sends it the JIT script itself, so nothing needs configuring for Henge inside StikDebug." = "StikDebug 是独立调试应用。Henge 会自动将 JIT 脚本发送给它，不需要在 StikDebug 中额外配置 Henge。";
"Install [StikDebug](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug/releases/latest)." = "安装 [StikDebug](https://github.com/StikDebug/StikDebug/releases/latest)。";
"Import this %1$@'s pairing file into StikDebug." = "将这台 %1$@ 的配对文件导入 StikDebug。";
"Install and connect [LocalDevVPN](%3$@)." = "安装并连接 [LocalDevVPN](%3$@)。";
"Whenever you start a Mac, Henge opens StikDebug, which attaches and comes back." = "每次启动虚拟 Mac 时，Henge 都会打开 StikDebug，连接调试器后再返回。";
"TrollStore can enable JIT for apps it installed, with no pairing file, VPN or computer." = "TrollStore 可为通过它安装的应用启用 JIT，无需配对文件、本地 VPN 或电脑。";
"Install Henge.ipa through TrollStore, on an iOS version TrollStore supports. It carries the entitlements TrollStore keeps, so the same file works there and in a sideloader." = "在 TrollStore 支持的 iOS 版本中，通过 TrollStore 安装 Henge.ipa。安装过程会保留 TrollStore 支持的签名权限。";
"In TrollStore's Settings, turn on URL Scheme. TrollStore ignores enable-jit requests without it." = "在 TrollStore 设置中启用 URL Scheme，否则它不会处理 JIT 启用请求。";
"Whenever a Mac starts, Henge asks TrollStore to enable JIT. TrollStore opens Henge, attaches to it for a moment and lets go, which leaves it allowed to run code it wrote." = "启动虚拟 Mac 时，Henge 会请求 TrollStore 临时附加调试器，随后即可执行 JIT 生成的代码。";
"On a device jailbroken with Dopamine, JIT is a setting: the jailbreak marks every app as debugged when it opens, and a debugged app may run code it wrote. Henge needs nothing else." = "在使用 Dopamine 越狱的设备上，可通过越狱设置启用 JIT；应用启动时获得调试许可后，Henge 无需额外配对。";
"Open Dopamine and go to its Settings." = "打开 Dopamine 并进入设置。";
"Turn on Allow JIT in Apps." = "启用 Allow JIT in Apps（允许应用使用 JIT）。";
"Close Henge completely and open it again. The setting applies to apps as they start." = "彻底退出 Henge 后重新启动；该设置会在应用启动时生效。";
"No jailbreak was found on this %1$@." = "未在这台 %1$@ 上检测到越狱环境。";
"This device closed the connection, which usually means it no longer accepts Henge's pairing. Pair again, and check that LocalDevVPN is connected." = "设备主动断开了连接，可能已不再接受当前配对。请重新配对，并确认 LocalDevVPN 已连接。";
"Henge couldn't reach this device. Connect LocalDevVPN, then try again." = "无法连接此设备。请连接 LocalDevVPN 后重试。";
"LocalDevVPN can show Connected while iOS still sends Henge's connection over cellular. Turn Cellular Data off in Control Center, wait 2 seconds, then turn it back on. Or join any Wi-Fi once; a hotspot works. Keep LocalDevVPN connected, turn off other VPNs such as Tailscale, then try again." = "即使 LocalDevVPN 显示已连接，iOS 有时仍会通过蜂窝网络发送调试流量。请在控制中心暂时关闭蜂窝数据后重新开启，或连接一次 Wi-Fi／热点。保持 LocalDevVPN 连接，并关闭 Tailscale 等其他 VPN 后重试。";
"%@ is installed on %@. Quit Henge (swipe it away) and open it again, then tap Start." = "已在“%2$@”上安装 %1$@。请彻底退出 Henge 并重新打开，然后点击“启动”。";
"This install needs about %@ free; this %@ has %@." = "安装需要约 %@ 可用空间，但这台 %@ 只有 %@。";
"The download kept failing." = "下载多次失败，请检查网络连接后重试。";
"Cannot create the disk." = "无法创建虚拟机磁盘。";
"Cannot create the auxiliary storage." = "无法创建虚拟机辅助存储。";
"Turn on JIT first: the installer runs the Mac's own restore system, which needs it." = "请先启用 JIT，安装过程需要运行 macOS 虚拟恢复系统。";
