"Put files in Files, Henge, Shared to see them in the Henge folder in this Mac's home folder. What you copy on the Mac is copied here too, and the paste button pastes from here into the Mac." = "请将文件放入“文件 › Henge › Shared”，即可在虚拟 Mac 用户目录的 Henge 文件夹中查看。Mac 上复制的内容也会同步到这里，粘贴按钮可以向 Mac 粘贴内容。";
"Once for each Mac: open Terminal on the Mac, tap this, then press Return. When macOS asks about henge-agent and local networks, choose Allow. It types %@ and needs the Mac's keyboard layout to be U.S." = "每台虚拟 Mac 只需配置一次：在 Mac 内打开“终端”，点击此按钮并按回车。系统提示 henge-agent 或本地网络权限时请选择“允许”。它会输入 %@。请先将 Mac 的键盘布局切换为美式英语。";
"There is not room for this Mac's memory: it needs a few GB of free storage." = "可用存储空间不足，无法为虚拟 Mac 分配运行内存。";
"Installing %@…" = "正在安装 %@…";
"Unpacking %@'s disk… %.0f%%" = "正在解包 %@ 的磁盘… %.0f%%";
"Bringing in %@…" = "正在导入 %@…";
"A Mac's memory is kept out of this limit once JIT is on. If iOS refuses that, it uses free storage instead." = "JIT 启用后，虚拟 Mac 内存可不计入应用的内存限制。若 iOS 不允许，Henge 会尝试使用空闲存储空间。";
"This install isn't signed with the increased memory limit entitlement. Reinstall Henge with a certificate that has it. Export your Mac first if the reinstall replaces the app's data." = "当前安装的签名不包含增加内存限制的权限。如需使用，请使用具备该权限的证书重新签名。若重新安装可能清除应用数据，请先导出虚拟 Mac。";
"%@ used" = "已使用 %@";
"of %@" = "总计 %@";
"The folder is missing %@." = "导入文件夹缺少 %@。";
"The packed disk could not be unpacked (not enough space?)." = "无法解包虚拟机磁盘，可能是存储空间不足。";
"Exporting %@ needs about %@ free; this %@ has %@. Deleting a downloaded macOS installer (Install macOS, swipe it) frees about 16 GB." = "导出“%@”需要约 %@ 可用空间，但这台 %@ 只有 %@。可以在“安装 macOS”界面删除已下载的系统镜像，释放约 16 GB 空间。";
"The disk could not be written (not enough space?)." = "无法写入磁盘，可能是存储空间不足。";
"Henge couldn't get the Mac's boot ROM from Apple (%@). Check the connection and try again." = "Henge 无法从 Apple 获取虚拟 Mac 的启动固件（%@）。请检查网络后重试。";
"The Mac's boot ROM from Apple wasn't what Henge expected, so it wasn't used. Check the connection and try again, or look for an update to Henge." = "从 Apple 获取的启动固件校验不符合预期，Henge 已拒绝使用该文件。请检查网络后重试，或等待 Henge 更新。";
"Built-in JIT is available only on a physical device." = "内置 JIT 仅支持真实 iPhone 或 iPad 设备。";
"Built-in JIT needs iOS 26 or later. Use StikDebug instead." = "内置 JIT 需要 iOS 26 或更高版本。你可以改用 StikDebug。";
"Built-in JIT is unavailable inside LiveContainer. Use StikDebug instead." = "在 LiveContainer 中无法使用内置 JIT，请改用 StikDebug。";
"Built-in JIT is unavailable." = "当前设备无法使用内置 JIT。";
"TrollStore did not enable JIT. In TrollStore's Settings turn on URL Scheme, and make sure Henge was installed through TrollStore (or is signed with get-task-allow)." = "TrollStore 未能启用 JIT。请在其设置中打开 URL Scheme，并确认 Henge 通过 TrollStore 安装（或签名保留 get-task-allow）。";
